arxiv-2412-01149.description:
A 2024 arXiv research paper by Joseph McGovern. We apply the methods of
[
1
]
to compute generating series of D4D2D0 indices with a single unit of D4 charge for several compact Calabi-Yau threefolds, assuming modularity of these indices. Our examples include a
\mathbbl{Z}_{7}
quotient of Rødland’s pfaffian threefold, a
\mathbbl{Z}_{5}
quotient of Hosono-Takagi’s double quintic symmetroid threefold, the
\mathbbl{Z}_{3}
quotient of the bicubic intersection in
\mathbbl{P}^{5}
, and the
\mathbbl{Z}_{5}
quotient of the quintic hypersurface in
\mathbbl{P}^{4}
.
